==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Iwate Prefecture'''.
*Iwate Prefecture's base is a visual pun on [[wikipedia:Wanko soba|''wanko soba'']], a noodle dish originating from Iwate. In the prefecture's regional dialect, ''wanko'' means "bowl", but in other contexts it would be a childish way of saying "doggy" or "puppy". Thus, the ''wanko'' is eating ''wanko soba''.
**Wanko is also [[Doge]]'s Japanese name, but the dog on the base looks more like a generic Shiba Inu than a Doge.

